e":"optional heartbeatMs?: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L103","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:103"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Heartbeat ping interval in ms (default 30_000)."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"idletimeoutms","children":[{"type":"text","value":"idleTimeoutMs?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional idleTimeoutMs?: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L109","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:109"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Close after this many ms without any inbound frame (default 300_000).\nNever fires while a turn is still streaming, so a long single generation\n(agentic loop, >5-min turn) is safe."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onrun","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onRun"}]},{"type":"code","value":"onRun: (ctx) => AsyncIterable<AGUIEvent>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L92","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:92"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build a fresh chat() stream for each inbound RunAgentInput frame."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"ctx-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ctx"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"WsRunContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"WsRunContext"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AsyncIterable"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AGUIEvent"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"toffset","text":"TOffset","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"batch","text":"batch?","level":3},{"id":"batchwaitms","text":"batchWaitMs?","level":3},{"id":"debug","text":"debug?","level":3},{"id":"durability","text":"durability?","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"heartbeatms","text":"heartbeatMs?","level":3},{"id":"idletimeoutms","text":"idleTimeoutMs?","level":3},{"id":"onrun","text":"onRun","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"ctx-2","text":"ctx","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:90](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L90)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### batch?\n\n```ts\noptional batch?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:96](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L96)\n\nChunks buffered per durability append (default 32).\n\n***\n\n### batchWaitMs?\n\n```ts\noptional batchWaitMs?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:101](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L101)\n\nMost ms a chunk waits in the batch for the next one before the batch is\nappended and sent anyway (default 50). `0` appends every chunk on its own.\n\n***\n\n### debug?\n\n```ts\noptional debug?: DebugOption;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:110](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L110)\n\n***\n\n### durability?\n\n```ts\noptional durability?: (ctx) => StreamDurability<TOffset>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:94](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L94)\n\nPer-TURN durability factory, keyed by the frame's runId via ctx.request.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`WsRunContext`](WsRunContext.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`StreamDurability`](StreamDurability.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n***\n\n### heartbeatMs?\n\n```ts\noptional heartbeatMs?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:103](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L103)\n\nHeartbeat ping interval in ms (default 30_000).\n\n***\n\n### idleTimeoutMs?\n\n```ts\noptional idleTimeoutMs?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:109](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L109)\n\nClose after this many ms without any inbound frame (default 300_000).\nNever fires while a turn is still streaming, so a long single generation\n(agentic loop, >5-min turn) is safe.\n\n***\n\n### onRun\n\n```ts\nonRun: (ctx) => AsyncIterable<AGUIEvent>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:92](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L92)\n\nBuild a fresh chat() stream for each inbound RunAgentInput frame.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`WsRunContext`](WsRunContext.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: WebSocketStreamInit\ntitle: WebSocketStreamInit\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:90](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L90)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TOffset\n\n`TOffset` *extends* `string` = `string`\n\n## Properties\n\n### batch?\n\n```ts\noptional batch?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:96](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L96)\n\nChunks buffered per durability append (default 32).\n\n***\n\n### batchWaitMs?\n\n```ts\noptional batchWaitMs?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:101](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L101)\n\nMost ms a chunk waits in the batch for the next one before the batch is\nappended and sent anyway (default 50). `0` appends every chunk on its own.\n\n***\n\n### debug?\n\n```ts\noptional debug?: DebugOption;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:110](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L110)\n\n***\n\n### durability?\n\n```ts\noptional durability?: (ctx) => StreamDurability<TOffset>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:94](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L94)\n\nPer-TURN durability factory, keyed by the frame's runId via ctx.request.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`WsRunContext`](WsRunContext.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`StreamDurability`](StreamDurability.md)\\<`TOffset`\\>\n\n***\n\n### heartbeatMs?\n\n```ts\noptional heartbeatMs?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:103](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L103)\n\nHeartbeat ping interval in ms (default 30_000).\n\n***\n\n### idleTimeoutMs?\n\n```ts\noptional idleTimeoutMs?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:109](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L109)\n\nClose after this many ms without any inbound frame (default 300_000).\nNever fires while a turn is still streaming, so a long single generation\n(agentic loop, >5-min turn) is safe.\n\n***\n\n### onRun\n\n```ts\nonRun: (ctx) => AsyncIterable<AGUIEvent>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts:92](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-to-websocket.ts#L92)\n\nBuild a fresh chat() stream for each inbound RunAgentInput frame.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### ctx\n\n[`WsRunContext`](WsRunContext.md)\n\n#### Returns\n\n`AsyncIterable`\\<[`AGUIEvent`](../type-aliases/AGUIEvent.md)\\>\n"}
